cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Afruz PXRD Analyzer in published work, cite this software release
  and the primary methodological references for the refinement methods used.
title: Afruz PXRD Analyzer
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Afruz
    given-names: Ali
    affiliation: University of Mohaghegh Ardabili
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2969-8428
