version: 23.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/AliAfruz/afruz-pxrd-analyzer
url: https://github.com/AliAfruz/afruz-pxrd-analyzer
abstract: >-
  A Windows-focused Python and PySide6 workbench for powder X-ray diffraction
  import, preprocessing, peak analysis, Pawley and Le Bail whole-pattern
  extraction, Rietveld refinement, quantitative phase analysis, validation,
  doping-series comparison, reproducible export, and crystallographic
  visualization.
keywords:
  - powder X-ray diffraction
  - PXRD
  - Pawley refinement
  - Le Bail refinement
  - Rietveld refinement
  - crystallography
  - materials characterization
  - metal-organic frameworks
  - Python
